{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cRcmizNHdL1794201224.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>立法會議員與行政長官、行會成員及政府高級官員午宴。</p><p></p><p>立法會主席李慧琼致辭時表示，議員北京之行聽取國家規劃，期望政府吸納議員意見，讓施政政策更科學化。她說，設立法會辯論內容資訊包，讓市民更了解立法會工作，而不同背景的議員協助政府落實五年規劃。她補充，立法會將努力說好國家故事。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.500017+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:18.055273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.718987+00:00","content_hash":"89e6f0e5e546f0d38de7ebe6042dfce22bbc9270db06f9d675b2479aa0fa901c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.500017+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}